    <http://example.org/node/chunk1> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Call for tenders – City of Belval Implementation of an artificial intelligence solution of assistance to the agents City of Belval 1." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk10> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The expected solution will have to take into account the context of the file when this one is available. 3.4 Collaboration and continuity of processing The expected solution will have to facilitate the continuity of the processing of the files between agents and services, by allowing: a sharing of relevant information, an understanding of the context of an ongoing file, an effective resumption of the processing by another agent. 4." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk100> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "That being said, considering The client global budget of 3000000 euros over four years, our average annual revenue is approximately 4.2 million euros, which suggests our have experience handling projects of similar scale." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk101> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given our target gross margin percentage of 28% and minimum acceptable margin percentage of 18%, our would aim to achieve a margin within this range for this project." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk102> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To optimize costs while ensuring compliance with budgetary constraints, our could propose strategies such as process improvements, efficient resource allocation, and potential renegotiation of rates with subcontractors if needed. our cost sensitivity analysis suggests that our can absorb a 10% budget reduction via rate renegotiation with subcontractors, which could be explored to optimize costs." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk103> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, without more specific details on the project requirements and scope, it is challenging to provide a precise projected margin or detailed cost-optimization strategies. our would need to conduct a thorough analysis of this project needs and our resource capabilities to determine the best approach for ensuring compliance with budgetary constraints while achieving our target margins." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk104> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client expects an artificial intelligence solution that assists agents in agents administrative activities, providing quick access to reliable and up-to-date information, improving the quality of answers, and reducing processing times." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk105> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must be capable of contextualizing answers based on the agent's demand, assisting with drafting administrative contents, and suggesting actions or verifications to carry out." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk106> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "How will we design the AI components to meet these requirements, ensuring explainability, transparency, and compliance with regulatory constraints?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk107> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To design the AI components, we will leverage we expertise in large language models (LLMs) and retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) capabilities. we preferred sovereign model, Mistral 7B Instruct, will be fine-tuned using we established methods, such as LoRA or QLoRA, to adapt to the specific tone and format of administrative contents." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk108> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The RAG component will enable The solution to retrieve relevant information from internal procedures, applicable regulatory texts, and other reliable sources, ensuring that agents have quick access to up-to-date information. we experience with vector stores like Qdrant and Weaviate will facilitate the implementation of an efficient retrieval strategy." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk109> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To contextualize answers based on the agent's demand, we will utilize we expertise in semantic chunking and document-aware splitting. utilize will allow The solution to understand the context of the ongoing file and provide relevant information accordingly." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk11> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regulatory and legal constraints The expected solution will have to imperatively respect the regulatory requirements in force. 4.1 Protection of data The holder will have to guarantee a strict compliance to the General Regulation on the Protection of Data (GDPR)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk110> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For drafting administrative contents, we AI model will be trained to generate high-quality text based on the input provided by the agents. we will ensure that the generated content complies with the requirements of quality expected and is adapted to the administrative context." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk111> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To suggest actions or verifications to carry out, we will implement a decision-support component that relies on we expertise in knowledge graphs and procedural reasoning. a decision-support component that relies on our expertise in knowledge graphs and procedural reasoning will enable The solution to propose relevant information and recall applicable rules, facilitating the agents work." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk112> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Explainability and transparency will be ensured through we established methods for model interpretability, such as SHAP, LIME, and source citation (RAG grounding). we will also provide confidence scoring and display uncertainty warnings when necessary, allowing agents to validate the outputs explicitly." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk113> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Compliance with regulatory constraints will be guaranteed by adhering to the EU AI Act's limited risk requirements and ensuring that we solution respects the principles of data protection, as outlined in the EU AI Act's. we hosting infrastructure will be located within the European Union, and we will ensure that all data is protected in an appropriate manner, using encryption and anonymization when necessary." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk114> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By leveraging we expertise in AI research and development, LLMs, RAG, and explainability, we are confident that our solution will meet the client's requirements and provide a valuable tool for agents to improve agents administrative activities." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk115> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client aims to reduce The client environmental footprint through sustainable development policies and wishes to limit the energetic consumption of The client information systems." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk116> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The proposed solution must contribute to reducing energetic consumption and rely on infrastructures with low carbon impact." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk117> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What strategies will we implement to ensure The proposed solution is environmentally friendly, contributes to sustainability goals, and complies with environmental regulations?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk118> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "As CSR & Sustainability Officer at Nexus Engineering S.r.l., I can outline the strategies that align with we existing capabilities and commitments to sustainability.  we have already implemented digital sobriety practices such as INT8/INT4 model quantisation, which reduces GPU energy by approximately 40%, auto-scaling to zero outside business hours, query result caching that estimates a 20% recompute reduction, and a green IT hardware procurement policy with a minimum 5-year lifecycle.  we hosting partners, OVHcloud and Scaleway, both located in France, use 100% renewable energy, have low power usage effectiveness (PUE) scores of 1.3 and 1.28 respectively, and are ISO14001 certified." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk119> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "This ensures that we data centers have a minimal environmental impact. we also have an e-waste management partner, Ecologic, which is certified for WEEE recycling, ensuring responsible disposal of electronic waste." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk12> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To this title: the data will have to be hosted exclusively on the territory of the European Union, no transfer of data outside the European Union will be authorized, the data will have to be protected in an appropriate manner (encryption, anonymization if necessary). 4.2 Explicability and transparency the local authority expects that the recommendations or proposals issued by The expected solution can be explained." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk120> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, we aim to reduce we total Scope 1 & 2 greenhouse gas emissions (currently at 148 tCO2e) and strive for net-zero by 2040. we has conducted a Bilan Carbone in 2023, demonstrating we commitment to understanding and mitigating our environmental impact." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk121> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By leveraging these existing practices and partnerships, we can ensure that The proposed solution not only meets but exceeds the client's expectations regarding environmental sustainability and regulatory compliance, aligning with the client's policy of sustainable development and reducing the environmental footprint of the client's information systems." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk122> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The City of Belval's call for tenders for the implementation of an artificial intelligence solution to assist agents in agents daily missions is a significant opportunity for our consortium to provide a comprehensive and innovative response. our consortium proposal is guided by the requirements and constraints outlined in the tender, with a focus on improving the efficiency of administrative services, enhancing the quality of service rendered to users, and reducing processing times. an artificial intelligence solution to assist agents in their daily missions is designed to integrate with existing practices and systems, ensuring a seamless transition for agents. an artificial intelligence solution to assist agents in their daily missions will be accessible from agents work environment, allowing agents to quickly access reliable and up-to-date information from internal procedures, applicable regulatory texts, and other relevant sources. an artificial intelligence solution to assist agents in their daily missions will also provide assistance with drafting administrative contents, such as answers to users, administrative letters, and syntheses of files." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk123> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To ensure an artificial intelligence solution to assist agents in their daily missions meets the needs of the municipal services, our consortium will conduct a progressive deployment, starting with a pilot phase on a limited scope and progressively generalizing to the entirety of the municipal services. our consortium approach prioritizes sovereignty, with data hosted exclusively on the territory of the European Union and protected by the General Regulation on the Protection of Data (GDPR). our consortium will also ensure that an artificial intelligence solution to assist agents in their daily missions is designed as a tool of assistance, guaranteeing explainable and transparent recommendations or proposals, with a posteriori understanding of the elements leading to an answer or suggestion. our consortium team has extensive experience in managing large-scale projects in the public sector, with expertise in digital transformation, AI solutions, and smart cities. our consortium employ a PRINCE2 Agile Scrum Safe methodology, ensuring effective project management and risk mitigation. our consortium has a strong track record of delivering successful projects, with a budget of 3,000,000 euros and a largest project managed worth 4,500,000 euros." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk124> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In terms of costs, Our proposal is aligned with the budgetary constraints outlined in the tender, with a total budget of 3,000,000 euros over four years. our consortium have conducted a cost sensitivity analysis, demonstrating that our consortium can absorb a 10% budget reduction via rate renegotiation with subcontractors if needed. our consortium pricing model and current financial position ensure that our consortium can deliver the project within the allocated budget." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk125> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To address the environmental concerns outlined in the tender, an artificial intelligence solution to assist agents in their daily missions relies on infrastructures with low carbon impact, reducing energetic consumption and contributing to the reduction of The City of Belval's environmental footprint. our consortium have conducted a bilan carbone, with a total scope 1, 2 greenhouse gas emissions of 148 tCO2e, and aim to reach net zero by 2040." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk126> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In conclusion, our consortium is confident that Our proposal meets the requirements and constraints outlined in the tender, providing a comprehensive and innovative artificial intelligence solution to assist agents in agents daily missions. our consortium are committed to delivering a high-quality project, ensuring sovereignty, security, and environmental sustainability, while optimizing costs and guaranteeing a certain level of service." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk13> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "It will have to be possible, a posteriori, to understand the elements having led to an answer or a suggestion. 4.3 Responsibility The expected solution will have to be designed as a tool of assistance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

